>Can you give me some hints how to get a lot of food ?
>My 7th Barbarian dies , because he has no food...
>(All Rations, Corpses etc. are eaten)

You should very rarely die from starvation. When you get to fainting,
pray, and your stomach will be filled. This will provide you with
enough food to get down another level or two to some more monsters or
rations. (Of course, we all know however that when you are in real
trouble monsters never leave corpses.)

It may also be in your case that you are spending too long on each
level??

